<title>UK: British Biotech has 8.0 mln stg Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>British Biotech has 8.0 mln stg Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax loss		8.0		    vs 7.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   0.53		   vs 0.34</p>
<p> Operating loss	   7.92		   vs 6.37</p>
<p> Admin expenditure	1.70		   vs 1.41</p>
<p> Interest receivable    1.17		   vs 0.62</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.11		   vs 0.14</p>
<p> Tax paid		   0.08		   vs nil</p>
<p> Net taxed		  8.04		   vs 6.95</p>
<p> Loss per share (pence) 1.4		    vs 1.4</p>
<p>NOTE - British Biotech Plc said its loss before and after tax for the first quarter was well within budget. It said a rights issue in July had raised 143 million stg net of expenses and it ended the quarter with cash reserves of over 200 million.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
